  "behavior_evidence": [
    "Actual public-client movement to a separately configured SIP account completes before DTMF. The producing native credential and original replacement controller credential are revoked and the original preparation deadline expires. Current independently decoded marked duplex continues before and after both DTMF methods.",
    "Under each signing algorithm, withdrawing only the established route named receive permission preserves the connected call/media while the public signed command fails without a frozen schedule or INFO; exact replay stays failed. Restoring the original permission allows fresh INFO and RFC4733 on that same call.",
    "Actual INFO receives exact digits5/8/# with Duration100 on the original dialog; three original requests are recorded. Actual RFC4733 uses negotiated PT101/8kHz, exact800sample duration, three distinct events and three terminal packets each. The frozen original recipient/result retains generation2 and the exact logical/physical call binding.",
    "Each completed command replays its original result without extra tones or a new call. Durable source provenance remains uctp-native; established target metadata contains its own route credential and no invented endpoint credential/revision or native signing key.",
    "Controlled Store tests reject14 altered/bogus call/generation/route/identity/signing fields and a borrowed native parent, enforce immutable sealed custody, roll back failed schedule reservations, preserve one original schedule, settle known outcomes after rights loss, recover original attempted uncertainty without resubmission, and detect recipient-only snapshot mutation.",
    "Both existing initial-call production methods pass again under both signing algorithms, with their original exact INFO/RFC4733/no-replay assertions and schema validation."
  ],
  "intermediate_checks": [
    "A test initially accessed the private expected_revision field; switched to its public getter. Six fixture admissions then correctly refused mismatched by_participant payload/root values; fixed the controlled request. A recovered status read also correctly required operation.get, added to that fixture only. These attempts earn no pass credit.",
    "First two production attempts returned not-recipient after successful committed-call audio. The new discovery had incorrectly required a disposable committed-preparation worker and the immutable preparation BindingState to remain Active. Final discovery uses the established actual owner; immutable ConnectionBinding snapshots retain Preparing. The first two refusals are preserved without attributing the sole cause to either predicate.",
    "With discovery corrected, actual INFO reached the peer, whose old assertion searched only native_dtmf_gateways. The peer panicked before acknowledging; generalized the exact ledger check to SIP entries in the shared view. This is a fixture limitation, not evidence that an INFO lacked its real established reservation. Final full scenes pass.",
    "Initial public-type rebuild took14m09s. The compiler remained live and CPU-active; a captured sample shows MIR type/trait validation. No compiler was interrupted or cache retired. Subsequent body/test rebuilds completed warm. Existing upstream private-interface and macOS linker unwind-size warnings remain recorded."
  ],
